      "cooked": "<p>Yup, suckered in and addicted to the &gt;G crack! :)</p><p>I tihnk the cards will still get more playtime from me as my gaming group meets up very, very sporadically these days and the lack of solo play for Tactics will hamper its time spent out of the box, but its a wonderfully presented and produced game and I'm glad I got it. &nbsp;Just a shame I didnt do it a month ago and get in on the For Profit preorder hehe.</p><p>Now, where can I find Uprising and it's minis cheap...</p>",
